+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_QUERY_FAILED
+Model or body query failed. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_TREE_FAILED
+Element tree preparation failed. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_READ_ONLY
